{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 167061, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 111537, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "装备强化", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1663130776, "updated_at": 1664697407, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1664961161, "last_at": 1681526593, "comment_count": 3, "status": 1, "summary": "前言1、其实强化系统也没什么好说的。2、强化所需材料与经验可以去参考《魂卡价值与升级》起因参考学习隔壁资料的时候看见了这么一个帖子。隔壁管理都在笑他（我也在笑）看了其他人回复发现可能很多人都不知道于是", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_809/h_836/1069/87565/2022/8/14/249385.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/8/14/684133.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/8/14/493597.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 6, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 35224, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 4, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 167061, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、其实强化系统也没什么好说的。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2、强化所需材料与经验可以去参考《<span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/154878.html\" target=\"_blank\">魂卡价值与升级</a></span></span>》</span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">起因</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">参考学习隔壁资料的时候看见了这么一个帖子。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"609\" data-height=\"169\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_609/h_169/1069/87565/2022/8/14/197204.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_609/h_169/1069/87565/2022/8/14/197204.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">隔壁管理都在笑他（我也在笑）</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"211\" data-height=\"124\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_211/h_124/1069/87565/2022/8/14/234861.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_211/h_124/1069/87565/2022/8/14/234861.png\"><img data-width=\"191\" data-height=\"77\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_191/h_77/1069/87565/2022/8/14/972790.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_191/h_77/1069/87565/2022/8/14/972790.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">看了其他人回复发现可能很多人都不知道</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"809\" data-height=\"836\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_809/h_836/1069/87565/2022/8/14/249385.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_809/h_836/1069/87565/2022/8/14/249385.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">于是</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"456\" data-height=\"81\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_456/h_81/1069/87565/2022/8/14/573582.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_456/h_81/1069/87565/2022/8/14/573582.png\"></div></div></div><br></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">装备强化</span></div></div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">普通装备强化有两种方法：</span></span></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、使用其他不用的装备用来强化。（不推荐）（因为要留给魂卡）</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、使用装备强化磨具强化。（推荐）（因为翻牌本给一大堆）</div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"588\" data-height=\"204\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_588/h_204/1069/92835/2022/6/1/777370.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_588/h_204/1069/92835/2022/6/1/777370.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_588/h_204/1069/92835/2022/6/1/777370.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"18\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; width: 250px; height: 86px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">界面参考</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/8/14/684133.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/8/14/684133.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></div>\n                               </div><br></div></span></span><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">魂卡强化</span></div></div><br></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">魂卡除了强化还可以突破：</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;强化<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">（只有这个途径）</span>：使用不用的装备用来强化（所以别用装备强化装备了）</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;突破有X种方式：</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1、用其他狗粮魂卡突破(不推荐)(突破经验少的可怜不如留着当卡片收集)(买了也不值钱)</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2、用枕头强化：枕头一共有三种，（推荐）（因为翻牌本给一大堆）</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3、使用同魂卡突破：与天子突破一样，并且原有带+值的魂卡可以被突破目标继承且额外+1</div><blockquote style=\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;举例：原有5张白卡合成在一起变成1张+4，获得闪卡以后直接突破变为闪卡+5。（用闪卡吃白卡，可别用白卡吃闪卡然后来找我）<div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">魂卡突破参考</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/8/14/493597.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/8/14/493597.jpg\"></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div></blockquote></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"><div></div></blockquote><blockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"><div></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">人偶强化</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">人偶除了升级也可以突破：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;强化：使用棉花强化（推荐）</span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;使用不要的人偶强化（不推荐）</span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;突破：使用相同的人偶突破</span></span></div><div></div></span><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></div><div>我人偶玩的是真垃圾，其他大佬有兴趣做图片扩展这里吧。</div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></div